  "environment": [
    { "name": "IPFS_TELEMETRY", "value": "off" }
  ],
  "settings": [
    { "key": "Plugins.Plugins.telemetry.Disabled", "value": true },
    { "key": "Bootstrap", "value": [] },
    { "key": "AutoConf.Enabled", "value": false },
    { "key": "Discovery.MDNS.Enabled", "value": false },
    { "key": "Routing.Type", "value": "none" },
    { "key": "Routing.DelegatedRouters", "value": [] },
    { "key": "DNS.Resolvers", "value": {} },
    { "key": "Ipns.DelegatedPublishers", "value": [] },
    { "key": "AutoTLS.Enabled", "value": false },
    { "key": "Swarm.RelayClient.Enabled", "value": false },
    { "key": "Swarm.Transports.Network.Relay", "value": false },
    { "key": "Swarm.DisableNatPortMap", "value": true },
    { "key": "Addresses.Swarm", "value": [] },
    { "key": "Addresses.API", "value": "/ip4/0.0.0.0/tcp/5001" }
  ],
  "note": "Use fresh repositories on a Docker internal network. Allocated Kubo nodes stay online for Cluster connector APIs, with routing, discovery, telemetry and swarm listeners disabled. Network.Relay=false disables the virtual /p2p-circuit listener; RelayClient=false alone is insufficient. The independent source runs offline, never receives allocations and stops before target DAG and stored-byte checks. Proxy add returns Name/Hash/Bytes/Size (Size string); REST add returns name/cid/bytes/size/allocations (size number). Keep the real wire unmodified. No public network, reused volumes, unpin or GC."
}
